sequenceDiagram
    participant Client1
    participant Server
    participant Client2
    
    Server->>Server: socket(AF_INET, SOCK_DGRAM, 0)
    Server->>Server: bind(sockfd, port)
    Note over Server: Listening for datagrams
    
    Client1->>Client1: socket(AF_INET, SOCK_DGRAM, 0)
    Client2->>Client2: socket(AF_INET, SOCK_DGRAM, 0)
    
    Client1->>Server: sendto(sockfd, data, ..., server_addr)
    Note over Client1,Server: No connection setup!
    
    Server->>Server: recvfrom(sockfd, buf, ..., &client_addr)
    Note over Server: Gets data + client address
    
    Server->>Client1: sendto(sockfd, reply, ..., client_addr)
    
    Client2->>Server: sendto(sockfd, data, ..., server_addr)
    Server->>Server: recvfrom(sockfd, buf, ...)
    Server->>Client2: sendto(sockfd, reply, ...)
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Client1,Server: UDP: No handshake, Packets may be lost or reordered, Fast but unreliable
    end
